    "en": {
      "trackName": "24 Bubbles",
      "description": "Turn the classic 24 puzzle into a lively bubble-merging adventure.\n\nIn 24 Bubbles, there are no operator buttons. Simply drag two number bubbles together and the game automatically performs a valid operation. Correct combinations merge into a larger bubble—keep going until the final bubble is exactly 24.\n\nGAME MODES\n• Cloud Levels: 30 carefully arranged number puzzles.\n• Arcade Mode: Start with 30 seconds, earn time for every solved puzzle, and level up after every 10 consecutive wins.\n• Face-to-Face Duel: Share one device and compete across a split screen for 30 seconds.\n• Apple Watch Quick Challenge: Tap two numbers on your wrist for short puzzle sessions anytime.\n• Animated Tutorial: Learn naturally through gesture animation the first time you play.\n\nA DELIGHTFUL EXPERIENCE\n• Soft translucent bubbles, dynamic lighting, and satisfying merge animations.\n• Pickup, impact, burst, and victory sounds with haptic feedback.\n• The in-game interface supports Simplified Chinese and English.\n• Play on iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch. Progress stays on your device.\n• No account required.\n\nObserve the relationships between the numbers, discover the right merge order, and make the last bubble exactly 24!",
      "releaseNotes": "Added localized App Store information for major markets. Gameplay and progress remain unchanged.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/24-bubbles/id6795797443?uo=4",
